                    <div class="type-data">
                        
                        <div class="errata-date">August 14, 2026</div>
                        
                    </div>
                    <div class="errata-text">Data&nbsp;<a  href="https://ncses.nsf.gov/pubs/nsf22344/table/81" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" tabindex="0">table 81</a>&nbsp;through data&nbsp;<a  href="https://ncses.nsf.gov/pubs/nsf22344/table/84" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" tabindex="0">table 84</a>&nbsp;in<a  href="https://ncses.nsf.gov/pubs/nsf22344" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" tabindex="0">&nbsp;NSF 22-344</a>&nbsp;were published with the estimates in the incorrect columns, under the wrong labels. Related analysis in the &ldquo;<a  href="https://ncses.nsf.gov/pubs/nsf23310#barriers-to-innovation" rel="noopener noreferrer" tabindex="0" target="_blank">Barriers to Innovation</a>&rdquo; section of InfoBrief&nbsp;<a  href="https://ncses.nsf.gov/pubs/nsf23310" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" tabindex="0">NSF 23-310</a>&nbsp;similarly used the wrong information.&nbsp;<a  href="https://ncses.nsf.gov/pubs/nsf22344/table/81" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" tabindex="0">Table 81</a>&nbsp;through&nbsp;<a  href="https://ncses.nsf.gov/pubs/nsf22344/table/84" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" tabindex="0">table 84</a>&nbsp;have been replaced, and the &ldquo;<a  href="https://ncses.nsf.gov/pubs/nsf23310#barriers-to-innovation" rel="noopener noreferrer" tabindex="0" target="_blank">Barriers to Innovation</a>&rdquo; section has been updated to reflect the correct data.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        
            
        
            
        
