                <div class="col-sm-6 col-md-8">
                    <a  href="/pubs/nsbsep20261" class="errata-title cms-fa-pro" rel="noopener" tabindex="0">The State of U.S. Science and Engineering 2026</a>
                    
                    <div class="type-data">
                        <div class="errata-type">Indicators</div>
                        <div class="errata-date">May 4, 2026</div>
                        
                    </div>
                    <div class="errata-text">Figure 25 (“U.S. R&amp;D expenditures, by type of R&amp;D and performer or funder: 2024”) was published with data from 2023; the data has been updated to 2024. The report&nbsp;<a  href="https://ncses.nsf.gov/pubs/nsbsep20261/discovery-r-d-activity-and-research-publications-2#type-of-r-d" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" tabindex="0">sentence before Figure 25</a> had a typo and has been corrected to say business performed “65% of applied research” in 2024.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        
